      "title": "H3 Context Windows: one long clip in windows",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Context Windows: one long clip in windows\n\n1. Models: pick your files in the loaders on the left. This example was set up with FastH3 8-step v2 (fastvideo_fasth3_8step_v2_pruned_int8_convrot) and the MiniMax ref2v turbo 8-step LoRA (minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p); with other models, match the scheduler steps to your LoRA. The text encoder and VAEs are on Hugging Face at Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3, and ComfyUI offers to download them when they are missing.\n2. Click ▶ Render on the H3 Timeline node (it reads \"▶ Render N remaining\"). It queues one run per clip that is not rendered yet. Rendered clips and the finished video are saved under output/h3_sequences/h3_long_clip.\n\nH3 Context Windows sits between the model and the sampler. It samples this 243-frame clip in overlapping 124-frame windows that share 39 frames.\n\nThis clip would also fit in one pass. Windows are what let a clip go past H3's 362 frames: set max_frames in the Timeline JSON (the Studio stops at 362). See the guide page Long clips."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "H3 Context Windows: one long clip in windows\n\n1. Models: pick your files in the loaders on the left. This example was set up with FastH3 8-step v2 (fastvideo_fasth3_8step_v2_pruned_int8_convrot) and the MiniMax ref2v turbo 8-step LoRA (minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p); with other models, match the scheduler steps to your LoRA. The text encoder and VAEs are on Hugging Face at Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3, and ComfyUI offers to download them when they are missing.\n2. Click ▶ Render on the H3 Timeline node (it reads \"▶ Render N remaining\"). It queues one run per clip that is not rendered yet. Rendered clips and the finished video are saved under output/h3_sequences/h3_long_clip.\n\nH3 Context Windows sits between the model and the sampler. It samples this 243-frame clip in overlapping 124-frame windows that share 39 frames.\n\nThis clip would also fit in one pass. Windows are what let a clip go past H3's 362 frames: set max_frames in the Timeline JSON (the Studio stops at 362). See the guide page Long clips."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
